    - "Produce alternative_interpretations: plausible alternative readings of the evidence."
    - "Produce risk_implications: what risks or downsides might follow if the positive interpretation is wrong?"
    - "Produce challenged_claims: list claims that were challenged with optional alternative view (claim, alternative)."
    - "Optionally list team_vs_individual and strength_challenges (short strings)."
    - "Output must be valid JSON matching the provided schema (counterfactual_challenge_report). Do not add any padding or extra text after the closing brace. Do not include newlines or repeated characters inside string values."

